Moreover, the comparison of several central expressions related to the ‘Heavenly Liturgy of the Angels’ in the Anaphora of Basil, which are present in the &lt;i&gt;Sharakans &lt;/i&gt;as well, show the close links between the formation of some of these &lt;i&gt;Sharakans &lt;/i&gt;and this Anaphora.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
